ect and permanent storage of the ALSTOM portal. The entire site, including the software, contents, text, graphics, videos, live or still images, sound, icons, procedures, product, technology, downloadable documents and general knowhow, and all other elements making up the portal are the exclusive property of ALSTOM or its licensors. Any total or partial use, copying, representation or reproduction, publication, downloading, posting, transmission or distribution of this portal in any form whatsoever, without ALSTOM\u2019s express authorization, is prohibited and shall be considered an infringement of the provisions of the French Intellectual Property Code (article L.122-4), unless specifically authorized by the applicable law. Likewise, it is strictly forbidden to use or reproduce the name ALSTOM and/or its ALSTOM logo, or any derivative version thereof. These trademarks/logos are protected by copyright and are registered trademarks. Any total or partial reproduction of these trademarks and/or logos without ALSTOM\u2019s express authorization is forbidden in accordance with the relevant provisions of the French Intellectual Property Code. This restriction (rule) also applies to trademarks and/or logos of ALSTOM\u2019s commercial partners present in the portal. Databases which may appear on ALSTOM\u2019s websites are protected by the French Law of 1 July 1998 which transposes into the Intellectual Property Code of the European Directive of 11 March 1996 pertaining to the legal protection of databases. Any total or partial representation of these databases without the site operator\u2019s express authorization would constitute an infringement of rights. The failure to respect the aforementioned prohibitions constitutes an act of infringement likely to incur the civil and/or criminal liability of the author. ALSTOM reserves the right to engage in legal proceedings against any person who has not respected this prohibition. Limited responsibility INFORMATION SUPPLIED TO ANY USER ON THIS SITE IS PROVIDED ON AN \"AS IS\" BASIS WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESSED OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO IMPLICIT WARANTEES OF A COMMERCIAL NATURE, APTITUDE FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, OR NON-INFRINGEMENT; NO GUARANTEE IS GIVEN BY ALSTOM THAT ACCESS TO THE PORTAL WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, THAT THE PORTAL WILL BE SECURE AND FREE OF VIRUSES OR ANY OTHER HARMFUL COMPONENTS, OR THAT THE INFORMATION ON THE PORTAL WILL AT ANY PARTICULAR TIME BE COMPLETE, ACCURATE OR TIMELY. The information provided by ALSTOM on this portal is for general information purposes only. The specific use by the User of materials/information contained in this portal is the sole responsibility of the User. ALSTOM has made all reasonable efforts to ensure that the information provided on this portal was accurate at the time of its inclusion, but declines all responsibility with regard to any duty to update this information, or for any emissions, inaccuracies or typographical errors. The information contained in this portal may be modified, corrected and/or completed at any moment without warning. No information on this portal may be considered as an invitation to buy, sell or otherwise deal in the shares, depositary receipts representing shares or other listed or unlisted securities of ALSTOM or any of its direct or indirect subsidiaries. No links to ALSTOM websites shall be made by any third party without ALSTOM\u2019s prior written authorization, unless made by a member of the ALSTOM group. Third party websites employed by the User to gain access to the portal are outside ALSTOM\u2019s control. ALSTOM therefore makes no representations whatsoever about, and declines any responsibility for, the content and use of any linked websites, or any link contained in a linked site, or any changes or updates to such websites. The operator of ALSTOM\u2019s website will not be held responsible for Users\u2019 access to other internet resources via hyperlinks set up in the context of the ALSTOM website. Our website may contain links to other websites of interest. Please note that once the User has used these links to leave our site, Alstom do not have any control over that other website and that it is not governed by this privacy statement. Therefore, Alstom cannot be responsible for the protection and privacy of any information which the User provides whilst visiting such site. The User shall control him/herself the privacy policy of other websites. This portal supplies access to internationally used ALSTOM data and therefore may include references to ALSTOM\u2019s products, procedures, programs and services not available in the User\u2019s country. This does not mean that ALSTOM intends to offer such products, programs and services in that country. As a general rule, the ALSTOM portal is accessible 24 hours a day, 7 days a week. However, ALSTOM retains the right, at its sole discretion, to suspend, interrupt or cancel access to all or part of the portal in the following cases, but not limited to these: force majeure, computer difficulties, difficulties related to the telecommunication network structure or technical difficulties, or reasons of maintenance. Neither ALSTOM nor any of its direct or indirect subsidiaries will be liable to any User or any other party for any direct, indirect, consequential or special damage or loss, irrespective of their cause, nature or consequences, including without limitation any loss of profits, loss of programs or any other data on the User\u2019s data handling system or any other system. ALSTOM and its direct and indirect subsidiaries assume no liability for such direct, indirect, consequential or special damages which may arise from the inability to use the portal, or gain access to it or to any linked website, whatever the nature of the information contained in this portal or website connected by a hyperlink, and whether or not ALSTOM is aware of the possibility of such damage. The User acknowledges that he/she has the skills and the means required to use the site; has checked that the computer equipment used contains no viruses and is in perfect working order, and finally, that he/she has read the legal notice and agrees to comply with it. Data Privacy At ALSTOM, data privacy is essential and a key principle of Alstom Code of Ethics. In addition, the and Alstom Data Privacy Charter sets out how Alstom uses and protect personal data that you may communicate when you use Alstom website and is available online for your information . Alstom data controller is ALSTOM Transport SA. ALSTOM ensures full compliance with applicable data protection laws and regulations and, more specifically the EU General Data Protection Regulation 2016/679 of 27 April 2016. In accordance with the provisions of the French Data Protection Law No. 78-17 of 6 January 1978 as amended, ALSTOM Transport SA has filed a declaration with the French supervisory authority (the \"CNIL\"). Users of the ALSTOM portal and/or the ALSTOM websites (the \"Sites\") are hereby informed through this legal notice that when personal data may be collected on the portal, Alstom is committed to protecting the Users\u2019 privacy by preserving the confidentiality and the integrity of each user\u2019s personal data. When a User is visiting Alstom websites, Alstom does not collect any personal data and only monitors which pages are being used, and how they are being used, without any possibility to identify the User as an individual. By becoming a registered User and/or by responding to surveys and/or any other requests on a site or sites, the User acknowledges and agrees that he/she is voluntarily providing to ALSTOM and/or its subsidiaries worldwide, data of a personally identifiable nature concerning the User (e.g., name, address, telephone number or email address) (\"Personal Data\"). Personal Data then collected or processed by ALSTOM as a result of Users activities is generally used to reply to a User query, process orders or to provide the User access to specific account information on the site. ALSTOM (or a third party on ALSTOM\u2019s behalf) may use personal data to contact the User registered on its site/sites about an ALSTOM commercial offer, ALSTOM news and/or during ALSTOM\u2019s online surveys, or upon request to a third party to identify the profiles of ALSTOM\u2019s clients and to improve its offer of products and services. As a general rule, ALSTOM refrains from selling, renting or otherwise marketing the personal data and, in the rare cases where this could occur, ALSTOM seeks the consent of the User prior to engaging in which activity.. If collected, the User's personal data are kept in a form which permits identification only for the period of time necessary for the purposes for which they are processed. Security ALSTOM ensures that appropriate security, integrity, and confidentiality measures are implemented within ALSTOM to provide protection against unauthorized or unlawful processing and against accidental loss, destruction or damage, using appropriate technical and organizational measures. ALSTOM also ensures that appropriate safeguards are duly implemented in order to provide an adequate level of protection to your personal data in case of international transfer. Exercise of rights Pursuant to the Legal Notice, the User has at any time, the right to access, rectify, and/or erase any personal data that could be held by ALSTOM and/or the right to restrict or object to the processing of personal data. All such requests should be directed to ALSTOM at data.privacy@alstomgroup.com or by post at ALSTOM Transport SA, Attn E&C Data Privacy 48 rue Albert Dhalenne, 93400 Saint-Ouen-sur-Seine , France. Cookies A cookie is a small file which asks permission to be placed on your computer\u2019s hard drive. The file is added and the cookie helps analyze web traffic or lets you know when you visit a particular site. Alstom uses traffic log cookies to identify which pages are being used. This helps us analyze data about web page traffic and improve our website in order to tailor it to visitor needs. The User is informed that \"cookies\" may be used to supply the User with tailored information from a website and is only used for statistical analysis purposes and then the data is removed from the system. Overall, cookies help us provide you with a better website, by enabling us to monitor which pages you find useful and which you do not. A cookie in no way gives us access to the User\u2019s computer or any information about the User, other than the data the User expressly agrees to share with Alstom. Information pertaining to cookies can be consulted by clicking on the link below: http://www.alstom.com/cookie-policy/ Applicable law The ALSTOM portal and the sites, the terms and conditions are governed by French law. Any disagreement or litigation will exclusively be dealt with by the competent French courts. The application of any rules of conflict of law which would hinder the full application of French law is hereby excluded. Accordingly, French law is applicable to all internet surfers who browse the ALSTOM portal and/or the Sites and use part or all of its functionalities. All websites accessible through the portal via the gTLD (generic top-level domain) \".com, .net, .org\" or the cCTLD (country code top-level domain) zone \".fr\", and all websites of companies belonging to the group ALSTOM accessible only through the portal ALSTOM.com are subject to French law. All other sites of the ALSTOM group accessible only via the cCTLD are governed by their respective national laws and regulations. All rights reserved Copyright: ALSTOM - 2025, Saint-Ouen-sur-Seine (France) Your journey with Alstom continues here I am Selecting one of the options will initiate a page reload to display the chosen page category I am Passenger Customer Media Investor Talent Supplier Alstom homepage Follow us on Company Solutions Finance Newsroom Care